    },
    {
      "quote": "Its phlebotomists currently take physician-ordered blood draws (and saliva, urine, feces, and other samples) at collection centers the company operates at its headquarters in Palo Alto and at 21 Walgreens–one in Palo Alto and the rest in Phoenix.",
      "kind": "specific",
      "why": "Checkable by verifying the physical locations of the operational collection centers."
    },
    {
      "quote": "“I just think this is so exciting,” says Mark Laret, the CEO of UCSF Medical Center, about what he’s seen so far.",
      "kind": "specific",
      "why": "Checkable by interviewing Mark Laret or reviewing UCSF statements."
    },
    {
      "quote": "“The first time I heard about this, I thought it was snake oil and mirrors,” says David Helfet, the chief of orthopedic trauma at the Hospital for Special Surgery in Manhattan.",
      "kind": "specific",
